training-help = Enter the remaining mana or tries reported by the game. Requires approved world training rates. Assumes continuous exercise, sufficient charges, and no interruptions. Each charge takes two seconds; level thresholds are not inferred.
loot-help = Enter net proceeds after costs, in one currency. Each member gets the same whole-unit share. The remainder stays unassigned; prices and transfers are not calculated.
